Claude to Roblox Studio, gave it this prompt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:23.760
and it started creating all the scripts behind the&nbsp;
system you just saw. By the end of this tutorial,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:29.920
you'll be able to build this gun in your own game&nbsp;
and customize the damage, fire rate, reload speed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:36.880
and more. Let's jump right into step one! Go to&nbsp;
the start menu and open up Roblox Studio. You&nbsp;&nbsp;

